WEBVTT

NOTE
Audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2
File: disc02_19h.avi
Scene: Squall and Rinoa aboard the Ragnarok, escaping Esthar
Duration: approximately 9 seconds
Describes the dramatic liftoff and escape from Esthar with both protagonists safe aboard.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Squall and Rinoa burst through the Ragnarok's airlock hatch. They scramble into the cockpit as the ship's systems hum to life.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The red Ragnarok lifts off from Esthar, engines blazing with brilliant white and orange thrust. The spacecraft accelerates upward into the sky.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The ship streaks across the horizon, leaving Esthar behind. Squall and Rinoa have escaped together. They are free, and they have each other. That is what matters.